<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">

<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Actualización de Pedido - Higinex</title>
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
        }

        .email-container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 8px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
        }

        .status-badge {
            background-color: #dbeafe;
            color: #1e40af;
            padding: 8px 16px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 14px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            display: inline-block;
        }

        @media only screen and (max-width: 600px) {
            .mobile-padding {
                padding: 20px !important;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body style="margin: 0; padding: 40px 0; background-color: #f8fafc;">

    <table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%">
        <tr>
            <td align="center">
                <table role="presentation" class="email-container" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"
                    width="600">

                    <tr>
                        <td align="center"
                            style="padding: 30px; background-color: #ffffff; border-bottom: 3px solid #047857;">
                            <img src="{{logoUrl}}" alt="Higinex" width="140" style="display: block; border: 0;">
                        </td>
                    </tr>

                    <tr>
                        <td style="padding: 40px 40px 20px 40px;" class="mobile-padding">
                            <h2 style="margin: 0 0 10px 0; color: #1e293b; font-size: 22px;">¡Hola, {{customerName}}!
                            </h2>
                            <p style="margin: 0 0 25px 0; color: #475569; font-size: 16px;">
                                Tenemos novedades sobre tu pedido <strong>#{{orderNumber}}</strong> realizado el
                                {{createdAtLabel}}.
                            </p>

                            <div
                                style="background-color: #f0f9ff; border: 1px solid #bae6fd; border-radius: 8px; padding: 20px; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">
                                <p
                                    style="margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-size: 12px; color: #64748b; text-transform: uppercase;">
                                    Nuevo Estado</p>
                                <span class="status-badge">
                                    {{statusLabel}}
                                </span>
                            </div>

                            <h3
                                style="margin: 0 0 15px 0; font-size: 14px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #94a3b8; border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; padding-bottom: 10px;">
                                Resumen del Pedido
                            </h3>

                            <table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%">
                                <thead style="background-color: #f8fafc;">
                                    <tr>
                                        <th align="left" style="padding: 10px; font-size: 12px; color: #64748b;">
                                            Producto</th>
                                        <th align="right" style="padding: 10px; font-size: 12px; color: #64748b;">Cant.
                                        </th>
                                        <th align="right" style="padding: 10px; font-size: 12px; color: #64748b;">Total
                                        </th>
                                    </tr>
                                </thead>
                                <tbody>
                                    {{#each items}}
                                    <tr>
                                        <td
                                            style="padding: 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9; color: #334155; font-size: 14px;">
                                            {{displayName}}</td>
                                        <td align="right"
                                            style="padding: 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9; color: #334155; font-size: 14px;">
                                            {{quantity}}</td>
                                        <td align="right"
                                            style="padding: 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9; color: #0f172a; font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px;">
                                            {{lineTotalFormatted}}</td>
                                    </tr>
                                    {{/each}}
                                </tbody>
                            </table>

                            <table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%"
                                style="margin-top: 15px;">
                                <tr>
                                    <td align="right" style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; color: #0f172a;">
                                        Total: <span style="color: #047857;">{{totalFormatted}}</span>
                                    </td>
                                </tr>
                            </table>

                            <p style="margin-top: 30px; font-size: 14px; color: #475569; text-align: center;">
                                Te avisaremos nuevamente si hay más cambios en el progreso de tu envío.
                            </p>
                        </td>
                    </tr>

                    <tr>
                        <td align="center"
                            style="background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 24px; border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;">
                            <div style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
                                <a href="https://higinex.com"
                                    style="color: #64748b; text-decoration: none; margin: 0 10px; font-size: 12px;">Sitio
                                    Web</a>
                                <a href="https://higinex.com/terminos"
                                    style="color: #64748b; text-decoration: none; margin: 0 10px; font-size: 12px;">Términos</a>
                            </div>
                            <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 11px; color: #94a3b8;">
                                &copy; {{year}} Higinex S.A.S. - Bogotá, Colombia
                            </p>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                </table>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>
</body>

</html>